{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_088_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "01fa8f809e0ea799284ac3484061b623fec7fb5dda46b75a35271b99c5f54c3e", "ja": "なあなあ！　劇場に来る時、\n綿あめ持ってる子を見てん。\n近くでお祭りでもしてるんかな？", "zh": "喂喂！我来剧场的时候，看到一个拿着棉花糖的孩子。附近是不是在举办什么祭典啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_088_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "79e28d11ad2a36d61e16a8b5db984bd6ed42f64bd5cfa9aa372515a43fdec648", "ja": "そういえば…\n姫も、浴衣を着た女の子を\n見かけたのです！", "zh": "说起来……\n本公主也看到穿着浴衣的女孩子了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_088_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "4210001bd4e911a6b89bbdd2234cdf20309a4eba178f8c07ff0598553ade7514", "ja": "浴衣でお祭りかぁ～いいね、\n茜ちゃんはどっちも大好きだよ！", "zh": "穿着浴衣去参加祭典啊～真不错，小茜两种都最喜欢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_088_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "0aec8545a0f6a1d745173f121ff98e7a38e5be4a3225686cca43530d40b424a3", "ja": "茜ちゃんの浴衣姿、\nとってもきゅーと！だと、\n姫は思うのです！", "zh": "姬觉得，小茜穿浴衣的样子特别可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_088_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_088_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "4adc3f3020189ebd890007b90ee0f70a3f0ac51e7e74cca61f5fd9b65d32a8af", "ja": "そうなんだよ、まつりちゃん！\nプリティな茜ちゃんに、屋台の\nおじさんもオマケしてくれてね…。", "zh": "就是这样呀，茉莉！因为有可爱的小茜，屋台大叔还额外送了我东西呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
